# A token is not a card (CR 108.2, 111.1), so it does not trigger the Void on its way to the graveyard (CR 111.7). Lingering
# Souls makes two Spirits and is exiled itself as a card leaving the stack - its flashback is gone with it. Lightning Bolt
# kills a Spirit: the only trigger on the stack is the Bolt's own (one trigger, not two), and the Bolt is exiled.
# Bot1 keeps one Spirit and no graveyard holds a card.

